        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 9:23PM MDT until September 24 at 9:30PM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>Flood waters are receding. Flash flooding is no longer expected to
pose a threat. Please continue to heed any remaining road closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT Friday for portions
of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico.
</description>
